  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hey there. I’m an indie game dev. Name’s Trian.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002000740068006500720065002E002000492019006D00200061006E00200069006E006400690065002000670061006D00650020006400650076002E0020004E0061006D00652019007300200054007200690061006E002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And I’m a real pro when it comes to the mighty\npolygon.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000492019006D002000610020007200650061006C002000700072006F0020007700680065006E00200069007400200063006F006D0065007300200074006F00200074006800650020006D00690067006800740079000A0070006F006C00790067006F006E002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know the mighty Porygon?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020006B006E006F007700200074006800650020006D0069006700680074007900200050006F007200790067006F006E003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait, mighty Porygon or polygon?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006100690074002C0020006D0069006700680074007900200050006F007200790067006F006E0020006F007200200070006F006C00790067006F006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Did your tongue just glitch?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069006400200079006F0075007200200074006F006E0067007500650020006A00750073007400200067006C0069007400630068003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Both, kid! I’m versed in the Pokémon AND in the\nclosed 2D shapes made of straight lines!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No! I’m trying to tell you about polygons! Y’know,\nclosed 2D shapes made of straight lines?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThey’re used in 3D computer graphics, and\nPorygon is basically a collection of ’em!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 183
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See, the games you play are full of these 3D\ncharacters, which we in the biz call models.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’re created through a process called\npolygonal modeling.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650079201900720065002000630072006500610074006500640020007400680072006F00750067006800200061002000700072006F0063006500730073002000630061006C006C00650064000A0070006F006C00790067006F006E0061006C0020006D006F00640065006C0069006E0067002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Polygon models are made by sticking together\ntons of little polygons to make a 3D image!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The more polygons you use—and the tinier they\nare—the smoother and rounder a model ends up.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In the old days, it took tons of processing power\nto use tons of polygons, so most models looked<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nall blocky and funny, with lotsa angles.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "People say that the Pokémon Porygon was made\nusing the most advanced tech at the time, right?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nBut technology is always advancing.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Which brings me to the real reason for my talk.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680069006300680020006200720069006E006700730020006D006500200074006F00200074006800650020007200650061006C00200072006500610073006F006E00200066006F00720020006D0079002000740061006C006B002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Trade me one of your Porygon for one of mine!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400720061006400650020006D00650020006F006E00650020006F006600200079006F0075007200200050006F007200790067006F006E00200066006F00720020006F006E00650020006F00660020006D0069006E0065002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Will you trade me one of your Porygon for mine?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570069006C006C00200079006F00750020007400720061006400650020006D00650020006F006E00650020006F006600200079006F0075007200200050006F007200790067006F006E00200066006F00720020006D0069006E0065003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure, let’s trade",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007500720065002C0020006C00650074201900730020007400720061006400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not right now",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007200690067006800740020006E006F00770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I hope you’ll reconsider. Trading Porygon can lead\nto a real groovy experience!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Great! Let’s trade Porygon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007200650061007400210020004C006500742019007300200074007200610064006500200050006F007200790067006F006E002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come on, please! Trade me a Porygon in exchange\nfor mine!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D00650020006F006E002C00200070006C006500610073006500210020005400720061006400650020006D00650020006100200050006F007200790067006F006E00200069006E002000650078006300680061006E00670065000A0066006F00720020006D0069006E0065002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, I said PORYGON! I’m pretty sure I spoke\nclearly.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C002000490020007300610069006400200050004F005200590047004F004E0021002000492019006D00200070007200650074007400790020007300750072006500200049002000730070006F006B0065000A0063006C006500610072006C0079002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! It looks like it’s about to get...smoother?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006800210020004900740020006C006F006F006B00730020006C0069006B006500200069007420190073002000610062006F0075007400200074006F0020006700650074002E002E002E0073006D006F006F0074006800650072003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How’d you like my little surprise?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F00772019006400200079006F00750020006C0069006B00650020006D00790020006C006900740074006C0065002000730075007200700072006900730065003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, I gave the Porygon I sent you an Upgrade to\nhold.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C0020004900200067006100760065002000740068006500200050006F007200790067006F006E00200049002000730065006E007400200079006F007500200061006E0020005500700067007200610064006500200074006F000A0068006F006C0064002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Which made it evolve into Porygon2!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680069006300680020006D006100640065002000690074002000650076006F006C0076006500200069006E0074006F00200050006F007200790067006F006E0032002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See how smoothly rounded it is now? It’s the\nperfect illustration of how much games change<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwhen processing power improves!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Porygon2’s upgrades include AI, and it was even\nprogrammed for planetary development projects.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Porygon and its line are a bit of a handful to deal\nwith, but I still can’t help but love it.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hm? Wait, that flash just now...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D003F00200057006100690074002C0020007400680061007400200066006C0061007300680020006A0075007300740020006E006F0077002E002E002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Did you have your Porygon hold an Upgrade too?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069006400200079006F00750020006800610076006500200079006F0075007200200050006F007200790067006F006E00200068006F006C006400200061006E0020005500700067007200610064006500200074006F006F003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I was trying to surprise you, but you surprised me!\nWhat a great trade this turned out to be! Thanks!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maybe Porygon2 is ready for another upgrade...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100790062006500200050006F007200790067006F006E003200200069007300200072006500610064007900200066006F007200200061006E006F007400680065007200200075007000670072006100640065002E002E002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pory?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
